== r3.92 (D4): `inox run file.inox A B` gives A and B to the program, which
== reads them with ParamCount and ParamStr; Halt(Code) ends it with that
== status, which `inox run` keeps.
Use Std.SystemUtils

Main :
    for I in 1..ParamCount
        PutLn(I, ": ", ParamStr(I))
    ;
    Halt(ParamCount)
;
